<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss corporate bankruptcies up 6.5 pct Jan-April.</title>
<headline>Swiss corporate bankruptcies up 6.5 pct Jan-April.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss commercial register published 384 corporate bankruptcies in April, bring the 1997 total above 1,460, the Creditreform economic data group said.</p>
<p>&quot;Bankruptcy proceeding had to be opened for more than 1,460 companies from January 1 to April 30, 1997, which represents an increase of 6.5 percent from the sale period of 1996,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
